euthanasia.

10
00:00:39.731 --> 00:00:43.367
euthanasia means ending a patient's life to stop suffering.

11
00:00:43.667 --> 00:00:47.594
Euthanasia is legal in only a few countries.

12
00:00:48.294 --> 00:00:51.701
Your turn. Say: euthanasia.

13
00:00:54.401 --> 00:00:55.507
euthanasia.

